<title>POLAND: KRUSZWICA 96 NET FALLS TO PLN 5.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>KRUSZWICA 96 NET FALLS TO PLN 5.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.12 vs   3.57 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   3.66 vs   5.65 profit</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.39 vs   6.17</p>
<p> Sales		   42.29 vs  41.26</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     5.68 vs  15.81</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	11.48 vs  30.32</p>
<p> Operating profit    29.12 vs  58.09</p>
<p> Sales		  475.44 vs 543.21</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish edible fat producer is</p>
<p>Zaklady Tluszczowe Kruszwica SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
